id: evil-aura-villainous-form
name: Villainous Form
order: 1
slot: trait
# (1) The Evil Techniques, on the Techniques list while it is had (full-power.mjs techniqueItemsFrom).
grantsTechnique: Baked Sphere | ultimate | energy | clearing | 10 | twin-linked 1 wound; power-shot 2; sudden-blast 1; lead-up 1 clearing; restricted-transformation 2 evil-aura; self-explosion 1
grantsTechnique2: Gigantic Ki Blast | ultimate | energy | megaFlare | 9 | widespread-assault 1 sphere; terrain-destruction 3; intense-blast 1; maximum-charge 1; full-wager 1; mandatory-charge 3; concentration 1; restricted-transformation 2 evil-aura; all-or-nothing 1; exhaustive 1
grantsTechnique3: Marbling Drop | super | energy | combination | 10 | widespread-assault 1 sphere; knockback 1; power-shot 2; restricted-transformation 2 evil-aura; self-explosion 1
grantsTechnique4: Peeler Storm | super | physical | sweeping | 8 | hurricane-assault 1; terrain-destruction 3; staggering-attack 1; restricted-transformation 2 evil-aura; all-or-nothing 1
grantsTechnique5: Rage Saucer | super | physical | combination | 8 | widespread-assault 1 sphere; alotta-lotta-attacks 3; restricted-transformation 2 evil-aura
description: >
  Whether it's something you chose for yourself or something placed upon you, this upgrade to your power compels you to act like the villain you've become.
text: >
  Villainous Form: Whether it's something you chose for yourself or something placed upon you, this upgrade to your power compels you to act like the villain you've become.
  (1)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Evil Techniques (detailed below). You may use either your Force or Magic Modifier for the Damage Attribute of your Evil Techniques.
  (2)-[Passive]: Gain access to the Darkness Mixer Modifier Maneuver.
  (3)-[Passive]: When using an Evil Technique, you may spend Evil Points equal to 1/2 of the Ki Point Cost for that Attacking Maneuver instead of paying the Ki Point Cost.
  (4)-[Triggered]: If you Ki Wager a number of Ki Points equal to (or exceeding) 1/10th of your Max Capacity on an Attacking Maneuver, increase your Wound Roll for that Attacking Maneuver by G(T).
  (5)-[Graded]: Evil Aura has 2 Grades. Each Evil Aura Grade:
  • Sets the AMB (Attribute Modifier Bonus) of Evil Aura for the listed Attribute to the amount listed on the Grades table.
  • Sets the Stress Test Requirement for this Transformation.
  • Sets your maximum amount of Evil Points.

---

# (1) The Evil Techniques - its header, Restricted to Evil Aura; Force or Magic for their Damage Attribute: the table's. (2) the Darkness
# Mixer Modifier Maneuver, (3) Evil Points for half an Evil Technique's Ki Point Cost: the table's.

# (4) A Ki Wager of 1/10th of your Max Capacity or more: G(T) on the Wound - the table's (one of 1/4 is read; this one is not).

# (5) Its Grade's Evil Point Maximum: 10(bT) Villainous (Power of Evil's own), 15(bT) Supervillain.
[passive, effect 5]
if ($G >= 2) {
    evilpoints.max += 5(bT);
}
